  "system": {
    "identifier": "futton-boil-release-acidic-dragons-breath",
    "description": "<p>You fire a beam of corrosive steam in a straight line melting and eroding everything in its path. Creatures in a 30-foot long, 5-feet wide line must make a Dexterity saving throw, taking 6d8 acid damage, and gaining 2 ranks of Deteriorate on a failed save, or half as much damage and no further effects on a successful one.</p>\n<p>If this jutsu would deal damage to a construct, structure or Barrier, the affected construct, structure or Barrier treats this damage as if they are vulnerable to it.</p>\n<p>At Higher Ranks: For each rank you cast this jutsu above B-Rank, increase the cost of this jutsu by 3 and damage by 1d8.</p>",
